IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pua-offences`

-- Public Utilities Act 2001, ss 2, 26 to 59 (Parts 3B, 4, 4A Division 2 and 5), offences and penalties -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_public-utilities-act-2001_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Penalties`

#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined` `s 26 relocating or altering a Board water installation without approval` EQUALS 20000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined` `s 34 not reporting a pipe wasting water` EQUALS 5000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined` `s 39 entering Board premises without written consent` EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined` `s 41 supplying drinking water without approval` EQUALS 50000

#ASSERT `What is the longest I can be imprisoned in months` `s 41 supplying drinking water without approval` EQUALS 60
#ASSERT `What is the longest I can be imprisoned in months` `s 47A(1) damaging a water main under 300 mm` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `What is the longest I can be imprisoned in months` `s 37 using a supply reinstated without authority` EQUALS 0

#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for each day the offence continues after conviction` `s 37 using a supply reinstated without authority` EQUALS 250
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for each day the offence continues after conviction` `s 50(2)(c) interfering with a meter` EQUALS 2500

#ASSERT `Which s 47A(1) offence is damaging this main` 299 EQUALS `s 47A(1) damaging a water main under 300 mm`
#ASSERT `Which s 47A(1) offence is damaging this main` 300 EQUALS `s 47A(1) damaging a water main of 300 mm or more`

§ `Due diligence and s 56A`

#ASSERT NOT `Does the offence carry a due-diligence defence` `s 50(2)(c) interfering with a meter`
#ASSERT `Does the offence carry a due-diligence defence` `s 50(2)(d) altering or tampering with a meter`

#ASSERT `Can I escape conviction on the due-diligence defence` `s 47A(1) damaging a water main of 300 mm or more` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Can I escape conviction on the due-diligence defence` `s 47A(1) damaging a water main of 300 mm or more` TRUE TRUE

#ASSERT `Am I liable for my employee's offence` TRUE TRUE FALSE

§ `s 45A`

`a rooftop tank of my house on its own meter` MEANS `My tank` WITH
    `I am the person responsible for the security of the installation` IS TRUE
    `it has a free water surface under atmospheric pressure` IS TRUE
    `it is a flushing cistern or an animal drinking-trough or bowl` IS FALSE
    `drinking water is drawn from it` IS TRUE
    `it holds only NEWater` IS FALSE
    `the premises are residential` IS TRUE
    `the premises take their supply through a master meter` IS FALSE

`the tank of my condominium behind a master meter` MEANS `My tank` WITH
    `I am the person responsible for the security of the installation` IS TRUE
    `it has a free water surface under atmospheric pressure` IS TRUE
    `it is a flushing cistern or an animal drinking-trough or bowl` IS FALSE
    `drinking water is drawn from it` IS TRUE
    `it holds only NEWater` IS FALSE
    `the premises are residential` IS TRUE
    `the premises take their supply through a master meter` IS TRUE

`my toilet's flushing cistern` MEANS `My tank` WITH
    `I am the person responsible for the security of the installation` IS TRUE
    `it has a free water surface under atmospheric pressure` IS TRUE
    `it is a flushing cistern or an animal drinking-trough or bowl` IS TRUE
    `drinking water is drawn from it` IS TRUE
    `it holds only NEWater` IS FALSE
    `the premises are residential` IS TRUE
    `the premises take their supply through a master meter` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `Which storage tank security duties must I meet` `a rooftop tank of my house on its own meter` EQUALS `only the general duty to secure the tank against unauthorised access and tampering`
#ASSERT `Which storage tank security duties must I meet` `the tank of my condominium behind a master meter` EQUALS `the general duty and the detailed duties: authorised access, locked, checked, recorded, reported`
#ASSERT `Which storage tank security duties must I meet` `my toilet's flushing cistern` EQUALS `no s 45A duty falls on me`

