§ `ss 44E, 44J`

`notice 8 days after crossing 5% in 2024` MEANS `My notice` WITH
    `the date I became a 5% controller` IS (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2024)
    `days after becoming one that I notified the Board` IS 8
    `I was unaware of the contravention when it occurred` IS FALSE
    `days after becoming aware that I notified the Board` IS 0
    `it came from an associate's increase with no arrangement between us` IS FALSE
    `days after the contravention that I notified the Board` IS 0

`notice 14 days after learning of it` MEANS `My notice` WITH
    `the date I became a 5% controller` IS (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2024)
    `days after becoming one that I notified the Board` IS 40
    `I was unaware of the contravention when it occurred` IS TRUE
    `days after becoming aware that I notified the Board` IS 14
    `it came from an associate's increase with no arrangement between us` IS FALSE
    `days after the contravention that I notified the Board` IS 0

`crossing 5% in 2019 and never notifying` MEANS `My notice` WITH
    `the date I became a 5% controller` IS (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2019)
    `days after becoming one that I notified the Board` IS 400
    `I was unaware of the contravention when it occurred` IS FALSE
    `days after becoming aware that I notified the Board` IS 0
    `it came from an associate's increase with no arrangement between us` IS FALSE
    `days after the contravention that I notified the Board` IS 0

#ASSERT `Have I committed an offence by notifying the Board late` `notice 8 days after crossing 5% in 2024`
#ASSERT NOT `Have I committed an offence by notifying the Board late` `notice 14 days after learning of it`
#ASSERT NOT `Have I committed an offence by notifying the Board late` `crossing 5% in 2019 and never notifying`

